OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers angry at changes to bus
OL,4,Atimetable
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus passengers have expressed
OL,7,Ffrustration over a new bus timetable
OL,8,Fthey say has led to delays.
OL,10,FBosses said changes to Guernsey's bus
OL,11,Fschedule brought in on 7 September
OL,12,Faimed to include more frequent
OL,13,Fservices.
OL,15,FHowever, some passengers have
OL,16,Fcomplained the changes have led to
OL,17,Fpeople waiting a long time for buses to
OL,18,Farrive - including pupils who were late
OL,19,Fto school as a result.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
